cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: evalresp
abstract: >-
  evalresp calculates the frequency response of seismic, pressure, temperature
  and magnetic channels from FDSN StationXML or legacy SEED RESP files, as
  amplitude and phase, frequency/amplitude/phase, or complex spectra.  It is
  a command-line program, a set of libraries and a C API.
authors:
  - name: "EarthScope Consortium"
    website: "https://www.earthscope.org"
version: 5.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
license: LGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/EarthScope/evalresp"
keywords:
  - seismology
  - instrument response
  - StationXML
  - SEED
  - RESP
